# SOC-003 .gitignore (focused, preserves portfolio evidence)

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*$py.class

# Editor/OS
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Temporary analysis output
/tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.old

# Large transient packages (local installation artifacts)
packages/*.deb
!packages/README.md

# Large runtime/generated artifacts - keep small evidence, consider excluding very large
# PCAPs/pcapng - keep for portfolio evidence; if repo size becomes concern, can be external
# But for portfolio completeness, often kept; review before commit
